      "passage": "Last week, our school went on an exciting ski trip to the Alpine Resort. Before the trip, students had to select their own snowboards from the school's equipment room. Each person was allowed to bring only one piece of luggage, so packing was important. I brought a soft cushion for the bus journey to make it more comfortable. The resort was fantastic, with well-maintained pavements in the village area. We learned about health tips, such as drinking plenty of water, and we were given passwords for the online trip diary. During our stay, we had lessons from professional instructors who taught us how to snowboard safely. The resort offered many activities, and we had free time to explore. Exactly fifteen students participated, and the experience was so memorable that we hope to go again forever. It was a great adventure that everyone enjoyed.",
